### 时间线和照片列表接口测试

@baseUrl = http://localhost:9483
@api = {{baseUrl}}/api/v1

### 1. 获取照片时间线统计（全部数据）
GET {{api}}/photos/timeline
Accept: application/json

##
结果:{
  "code": 200,
  "message": "Success",
  "data": [
    {
      "date": "2024-10-05",
      "count": 1202
    },
    {
      "date": "2024-11-01",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "date": "2024-11-04",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "date": "2025-08-02",
      "count": 3
    }
  ]
}
##

### 2. 获取照片时间线统计（指定时间范围）
GET {{api}}/photos/timeline?start_date=2020-01-01&end_date=2024-12-31
Accept: application/json

##
结果：
{
  "code": 200,
  "message": "Success",
  "data": [
    {
      "date": "2024-10-05",
      "count": 1202
    },
    {
      "date": "2024-11-01",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "date": "2024-11-04",
      "count": 4
    }
  ]
}
##
