### 4. 获取照片列表（默认参数）
GET {{api}}/photos
Accept: application/json

##
结果：
{
  "code": 200,
  "message": "Success",
  "data": {
    "hash": ["f7b05e20e8ea554476dc581bb7b700ab5a039c85b29223067856e7650262880c", "5b1cc505e9b5365e6d6160aaa7df37082b110447fa901cdf6e75a0de639bbab2", "3184a0593924dd133aea6399ce5b4624f370189392dc6dad172ca908db4ae3a4"],
